# How to Run

1. Install dependencies
   pip install groq python-dotenv flask flask-cors

2. Start the API
   python airline_api.py

3. Send a review
   POST http://localhost:5001/analyze-review
   Content-Type: application/json

   { "review": "My flight was delayed 4 hours and no compensation was offered." }

4. Response
   { "message": "..." }
